          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong>COREtec Plus Premium</strong> is the pick when you want a premium floor that feels comfortable underfoot. Kitchens and pet households are best served by a 20 mil collection of <strong>Shaw Floorté Pro</strong> or <strong>Mohawk SolidTech Plus</strong>. A mid-tier <strong>Lifeproof</strong> or <strong>NuCore</strong> line delivers most of that performance for far less money, and <strong>Karndean Korlok Select</strong> earns its premium when realism comes first.
          </p>
